*已确认的根因：**\nPod 内部应用代码的逻辑依赖于某个外部服务或资源，该依赖在当前窗口内不可用（具体依赖名称未通过日志或 Trace 明确标识）。由于应用逻辑在检测到依赖失败时直接返回了 `503 dependency unavailable`（见 Logging 证据 #5 和 Tracing 证据 #6），导致 Kubernetes 配置的 Readiness Probe（探测路径 `/work` 或 `/ready`）持续收到 503 响应（见 Event 证据 #1, #4）。根据 Kubernetes 机制，连续探测失败导致 Pod 状态标记为 `NotReady`（见 State 证据 #2）。\n\n**不确定性说明：**\n虽然确定了“应用内部依赖不可用”这一层级原因，但具体的依赖服务名称（如数据库、缓存或另一微服务）以及依赖不可用的根本原因（如配置错误、服务宕机或网络隔离）在当前日志和追踪数据中未被明确标识或关联，属于未确认事实。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 75.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l: 75.2s (Evidence 65.8s, RCA 9.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 110.601, "metrics": {"run_id": "451b9a692190423b", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 110.60721850395203, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 110607.21850395203, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 97386.76452636719, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 22664.286613464355, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 12860.368728637695}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20417.606115341187, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 75162.16206550598, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 15006.917476654053, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

